{"id":"ru_ckwa_rts","lemma":"rückwärts","pos":"adv","rank":3400,"glosses":["backwards"],"ipa":"/ˈʁʏkˌvɛʁts/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/9/9a/De-r%C3%BCckw%C3%A4rts.ogg/De-r%C3%BCckw%C3%A4rts.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Er fiel rückwärts zu Boden.","en":"He fell backward.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/44950","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to fall, to drop","l":"fallen"},null,{"g":"to / too"},{"g":"ground, soil"}]},{"text":"Sag das Alphabet rückwärts auf.","en":"Say the alphabet backwards.","words":[{"g":"to say (to pronounce","l":"sagen"},{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"alphabet"},null,{"g":"on"}]},{"text":"Nicht rückwärts fahren! Hinter dir steht ein Baum!","en":"Don't back up. There's a tree behind you.","words":[{"g":"not"},null,{"g":"to go at speed"},{"g":"behind, after"},{"g":"(to) you","l":"du"},{"g":"to stand","l":"stehen"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"tree"}]},{"text":"Ich parkte rückwärts ein.","en":"I put my car in reverse.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to park","l":"parken"},null,{"g":"a"}]},{"text":"Bitte, sage das Alphabet rückwärts auf.","en":"Please say the alphabet in reverse.","words":[{"g":"please"},{"g":"to say (to pronounce","l":"sagen"},{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"alphabet"},null,{"g":"on"}]}]}